<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Reset Password – ARMC Portal</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f6f8fa;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      color: #333;
    }

    .email-container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      background: white;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
    }

    .header {
      text-align: center;
      padding-bottom: 15px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
    }

    .title {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #0d9488;
    }

    .content h3 {
      margin-top: 20px;
      color: #111;
    }

    .button {
      display: block;
      width: fit-content;
      background: #0d9488;
      color: white !important;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 20px auto;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .info {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .warning {
      background: #fff7ed;
      border: 1px solid #fdba74;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 15px;
      color: #9a3412;
    }

    .footer {
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 25px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #777;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      padding-top: 15px;
    }

    .link {
      word-break: break-all;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #555;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="email-container">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="header">
      <h2 class="title">ARMC Portal</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <h3>Reset Password</h3>
      <p>Dear <strong><%= fullName %></strong>,</p>
      <p>We received a request to reset your password for your ARMC Portal account.</p>
      <p>Click the button below to reset your password:</p>

      <a class="button" href="<%= resetLink %>">Reset Password</a>

      <div class="info">
        ⏱️ This link will expire in <strong>30 minutes</strong>. </div>

      <div class="warning">
        ⚠️ If you did not request this, please ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div class="footer">
    Regards,<br />
    <strong>ARMC Portal</strong><br />
    (Auto Notification System)<br /><br />
    <em>This email was auto-generated. Please do not reply.</em>
  </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>